EllipticIntegrals
*****************

Description
===========

This package provides some functions for computing elliptic integrals and
elliptic functions. The basis for the computations is the arithmetic geometric
mean, and the notation we use comes from the paper The arithogeometric mean
(see http://dangrayson.com/cv.xhtml#agm ), Archiv der Mathematik, volume 52,
1989, pages 507-512.

Author
======

  * Daniel R. Grayson (see http://www.math.uiuc.edu/~dan/ ) <dan@math.uiuc.edu>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.0 of EllipticIntegrals, released
February, 2008.

